Lock screen Arona: patting claims the gesture from the shade (a quick swipe up still unlocks);
touches anywhere on the shade window are observed (AronaGaze) so she looks there; her reply chip
lives in its own layer above the notifications and avoids the real clock, halo, fingerprint,
shortcuts and notification cards. Arona big (lobby, dynamic grown, big custom place) → the
keyguard clock is always small (KeyguardClockInteractor). Weather: retry as soon as the network,
location or screen is there (was: 45 min after boot). Widgets: redraw on light/dark change.

Change-Id: I6d08a0a10862fcf1f8e5c0d78bd80f2ae3e80a4a
